                    <simple-property-list name="value1"><value type="javascript">"Nothing to do"</value></simple-property-list></structure></list-property><property name="resultSetColumn">action</property></data></cell><cell id="195"><property name="paddingTop">4pt</property><property name="paddingBottom">4pt</property><property name="paddingLeft">6pt</property><property name="paddingRight">6pt</property><property name="verticalAlign">top</property><property name="borderBottomColor">#e0e0e0</property><property name="borderBottomStyle">solid</property><property name="borderBottomWidth">1px</property><data id="194"><property name="fontSize">8pt</property><property name="color">#525252</property><property name="resultSetColumn">why</property></data></cell><cell id="197"><property name="paddingTop">4pt</property><property name="paddingBottom">4pt</property><property name="paddingLeft">6pt</property><property name="paddingRight">6pt</property><property name="verticalAlign">top</property><property name="borderBottomColor">#e0e0e0</property><property name="borderBottomStyle">solid</property><property name="borderBottomWidth">1px</property><data id="196"><property name="fontSize">8pt</property><property name="color">#525252</property><property name="resultSetColumn">see</property></data></cell></row></detail>
        </table><data id="214"><list-property name="visibility"><structure><property name="format">all</property><expression name="valueExpr" type="javascript"><![CDATA[rows_dsAreas > 0]]></expression></structure></list-property><property name="fontSize">8.5pt</property><property name="color">#6f6f6f</property><property name="paddingTop">10pt</property><property name="paddingBottom">10pt</property><property name="paddingLeft">8pt</property><property name="borderBottomColor">#e0e0e0</property><property name="borderBottomStyle">solid</property><property name="borderBottomWidth">1px</property><list-property name="boundDataColumns"><structure><property name="name">v</property><expression name="expression" type="javascript"><![CDATA[readyEmpty("dsAreas", "The summary could not be read.")]]></expression><property name="dataType">string</property></structure></list-property><property name="resultSetColumn">v</property></data><grid id="217"><property name="marginTop">8pt</property><property name="width">10.1in</property><column id="218"/><row id="219"><cell id="220"><property name="backgroundColor">#edf5ff</property><property name="borderLeftColor">#0043ce</property><property name="borderLeftStyle">solid</property><property name="borderLeftWidth">3px</property><property name="paddingTop">6pt</property><property name="paddingBottom">6pt</property><property name="paddingLeft">10pt</property><property name="paddingRight">10pt</property><label id="221"><property name="fontSize">8.5pt</property><property name="fontWeight">bold</property><property name="color">#161616</property><text-property name="text">How to use this report</text-property></label><label id="222"><property name="fontSize">8pt</property><property name="color">#525252</property><property name="marginTop">2pt</property><text-property name="text">Start with the areas marked Rebuild, Rework and Replace: they need development work and testing. Reconfigure and Migrate are set-up tasks for the MAS administrator. Review means a person decides item by item. The sections that follow list every item, so the report doubles as the work list for the upgrade project.</text-property></label></cell></row></grid><grid id="226"><property name="pageBreakBefore">always</property><property name="pageBreakInside">avoid</property><property name="marginTop">18pt</property><property name="width">10.1in</property><column id="227"/><row id="228"><cell id="229"><label id="223"><property name="fontSize">7.5pt</property><property name="color">#0f62fe</property><property name="fontWeight">bold</property><property name="letterSpacing">0.32pt</property><text-property name="text">1  ·  JAVA</text-property></label><label id="224"><property name="fontSize">14pt</property><property name="color">#161616</property><property name="marginTop">2pt</property><property name="marginBottom">2pt</property><text-property name="text">Java customizations</text-property></label><label id="225"><property name="fontSize">8.5pt</property><property name="color">#525252</property><property name="marginBottom">8pt</property><text-property name="text">Classes on objects, attributes, services, cron tasks, actions, conditions, endpoint handlers and integration objects whose package is not IBM's. In MAS they are packaged into a customization archive that the Manage operator adds to the Manage image, so each one is rebuilt against the target Manage version and retested.</text-property></label></cell></row></grid>
