 DOCINFO paths are updated if the root folder changes. URL documents are links and move as they are.</text-property></label></cell></row></grid><grid id="376"><property name="pageBreakBefore">always</property><property name="pageBreakInside">avoid</property><property name="marginTop">18pt</property><property name="width">10.1in</property><column id="377"/><row id="378"><cell id="379"><label id="373"><property name="fontSize">7.5pt</property><property name="color">#0f62fe</property><property name="fontWeight">bold</property><property name="letterSpacing">0.32pt</property><text-property name="text">4  ·  INTEGRATION</text-property></label><label id="374"><property name="fontSize">14pt</property><property name="color">#161616</property><property name="marginTop">2pt</property><property name="marginBottom">2pt</property><text-property name="text">Integration endpoints and Maximo Anywhere</text-property></label><label id="375"><property name="fontSize">8.5pt</property><property name="color">#525252</property><property name="marginBottom">8pt</property><text-property name="text">Endpoints by handler. JMS, file (FLATFILE, XMLFILE), interface table, command line and EJB handlers depend on how the 7.6 servers are set up; HTTP and web service endpoints carry addresses that may change.</text-property></label></cell></row></grid>
